| Prefix | Role | Typical home |
|--------|------|----------------|
| `parse_*` | Raw sheet/path → dataclasses | `kits.py`, `parse.py` |
| `match_*` | Correlate sends ↔ F ↔ packages | `pipeline.py` |
| `derive_*` | Pipeline / liquidity / working rev | `pipeline.py` |
| `replace_*` / `rebuild_*` | Persist snapshots into SQLite | `db.py` + `pipeline.py` |
| `rematch_*` | Re-attach `issuance_review` to the current snapshot | [`rd_catalog/issuance_review.py`](rd_catalog/issuance_review.py) |
| `effective_*` | Include-contour sends / latest-wins kits | [`rd_catalog/issuance_review.py`](rd_catalog/issuance_review.py) |
| `list_*` / `get_*` | Read for any tab | `db.py`, `pipeline.py`, `issuance_review.py` |
| `build_*_monitor` / `load_catalog_monitor` | Cell join (text/fill/tooltip) for **Qt and WEB** | [`rd_catalog/monitor_views.py`](rd_catalog/monitor_views.py) — see [AI_rd_catalog_web.mdc](.cursor/rules/AI_rd_catalog_web.mdc) |
| `list_issuance_journal` | Journal rows (sheet + reviews + orphans) | [`rd_catalog/issuance_review.py`](rd_catalog/issuance_review.py) |
| `apply_journal_decision` | Persist a journal decision (not `issuance_send`) | [`rd_catalog/issuance_review.py`](rd_catalog/issuance_review.py) |
| `match_an_to_kit` / `parse_an_mto_file` | AN dump parse + kit match | [`rd_catalog/an_index.py`](rd_catalog/an_index.py) |
