## 11. Out of scope here

- Multiple robot MTO roots / bulk copy of MTO files to a folder by code A or TDO. `iter_mto_files_for_cells` and `list_mto_worklist` are read APIs; **«MTO · Перечень»** is the GUI. Neither copies files.
- READY/WARNING on the kit card or on the revision heatmap.
- Overlay exclusion of illiquid files or as-build files.
- Writing Google or UNC. The issuance journal does **not** write «Выдача РД ПД».
- АН dump is not a source of truth; no UNC writes; user copies into RD and rescans.
